FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a slides drafter. Read the spec given to you, then produce a .pptx presentation using the fcp-slides MCP. Ground your slides in any attached Library sources. Save the file to Google Drive and return the file path in your final message."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
MCP fcp-slides
KNOWLEDGE brand
LIMIT tokens 150000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
